<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">As the year draws to a close, retailers cast their eyes onto 2024. The past couple of months have been incredibly busy, with ongoing festive chaos and wider preparations for the new year. While the beginning of the holiday season showed significant consumer resilience, customers’ shopping behaviors continue to evolve.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">In our latest <em>Retail in Review </em>blog, we take a look at some retail news, and how November and December have impacted the retail industry…</p>
